# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Never publish: live credentials
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The Playwright profile holds the *logged-in Yad2 session* - Network/Cookies is
# a working credential. Anyone with these files is signed in as you. This is the
# single most important line in this file.
backend/.browser-profile/
backend/.browser-profile-active/
.browser-profile/

# bots/whatsapp/bot.js's default local auth dir - a live, logged-in
# WhatsApp session (Baileys), same sensitivity as the Yad2 browser profile
# above. In production this lives on the Render disk (WHATSAPP_AUTH_DIR),
# never in the repo.
bots/whatsapp/.auth/

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
secrets.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Never publish: personal data
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The database is not just large, it is *people*: advertiser phone numbers and
# names harvested from ONMAP, 30,515 named rights-holder hints tied to specific
# parcels, and saved lead notes. None of that belongs in a code repository, at
# any visibility setting.
data/
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-journal
*.db

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Too large for GitHub (100 MB per-file hard limit)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.zip
yad_madlen__all.zip

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output, caches, dependencies
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/
.vite/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local run artefacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
debug.log
inspect_output.txt
backend/test-artifacts/
*.png
!frontend/src/assets/*.png
